{"model": "Chatterbox Turbo (MLX 8-bit)", "segments": [{"text": "Over the last year, I’ve found myself increasingly jaded about the tech industry.", "block": 0, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/e6d35ee8bae55b16a2771af912395b0c14efca43bc599b2f57d7ef9c30f432d6.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.3], [1, 0.3, 0.44], [2, 0.44, 0.64], [3, 0.64, 0.98], [5, 1.28, 1.48], [6, 1.48, 1.82], [7, 1.82, 2.4], [8, 2.4, 3.06], [9, 3.06, 3.32], [10, 3.32, 3.48], [11, 3.48, 3.66], [12, 3.66, 4.14]]}, {"text": "Back when I was in high school (2004-2007) and college (2007-2011), the “uncool” kids hung out in the computer lab, experimenting with computers while the cool kids focused on developing skills in sports, music, debate, or just hanging out.", "block": 1, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/3f3a1a528ab7e910328b826dca5561fa83125bed5b11e3f2be802c4df4c652a4.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.22], [1, 0.22, 0.42], [2, 0.42, 0.56], [3, 0.56, 0.72], [4, 0.72, 0.82], [5, 0.82, 1.0], [6, 1.0, 1.34], [8, 3.16, 3.92], [9, 3.92, 4.3], [11, 6.82, 7.14], [13, 7.6, 8.02], [14, 8.02, 8.24], [15, 8.24, 8.5], [16, 8.5, 8.72], [17, 8.72, 8.84], [18, 8.84, 9.18], [19, 9.18, 9.7], [20, 10.12, 10.8], [21, 10.8, 10.94], [22, 10.94, 11.5], [23, 11.5, 11.84], [24, 11.84, 11.96], [25, 11.96, 12.18], [26, 12.18, 12.44], [27, 12.44, 12.86], [28, 12.86, 13.12], [29, 13.12, 13.5], [30, 13.5, 13.94], [31, 13.94, 14.22], [32, 14.22, 14.56], [33, 15.2, 15.48], [34, 15.94, 16.2], [35, 16.6, 16.86], [36, 16.86, 17.1], [37, 17.1, 17.34], [38, 17.34, 17.68]]}, {"text": "In my 2007 class of about 140 students, I didn’t really have a clique to hang out with, so I spent most of my breaks and lunches in the computer lab, learning how to write programs, break the school’s firewall, and even remotely shut down my bully’s computers before auto-save became a thing… [0]", "block": 2, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/96249c42771dcde2faf1390cf19fef5dad23b267b9955d16aa437eac48aa9c07.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.22], [1, 0.22, 0.34], [2, 0.34, 1.08], [3, 1.08, 1.52], [4, 1.52, 1.76], [5, 1.76, 1.98], [6, 1.98, 2.68], [7, 2.68, 3.44], [8, 3.64, 3.76], [9, 3.76, 4.04], [10, 4.04, 4.26], [11, 4.26, 4.44], [12, 4.44, 4.56], [14, 4.72, 4.92], [15, 4.92, 5.04], [16, 5.04, 5.22], [17, 5.22, 5.44], [18, 5.84, 6.0], [19, 6.0, 6.1], [20, 6.1, 6.32], [21, 6.32, 6.6], [22, 6.6, 6.78], [23, 6.78, 6.94], [24, 6.94, 7.24], [25, 7.24, 7.42], [26, 7.42, 7.78], [27, 7.78, 7.88], [28, 7.88, 7.98], [29, 7.98, 8.32], [30, 8.32, 8.74], [31, 9.1, 9.22], [32, 9.22, 9.44], [33, 9.44, 9.52], [34, 9.52, 9.64], [35, 9.64, 10.18], [36, 10.6, 10.72], [37, 10.72, 10.9], [38, 10.9, 11.26], [39, 11.26, 11.6], [40, 12.06, 12.16], [41, 12.16, 12.4], [42, 12.4, 12.74], [43, 12.74, 13.06], [44, 13.06, 13.3], [45, 13.3, 13.5], [46, 13.5, 13.88], [47, 13.88, 14.24], [48, 14.24, 14.64], [50, 15.2, 15.52], [51, 15.52, 15.7], [52, 15.7, 15.88]]}, {"text": "In engineering college, the CS students were kind of the weird kids, even among the engineers.", "block": 3, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/7d5e6a152cd1f12bfc2dea145e1d8497efb260979609ee09ecfad0defc1209b7.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.26], [1, 0.26, 0.68], [2, 0.68, 1.14], [3, 1.58, 1.66], [4, 1.66, 1.88], [5, 1.88, 2.3], [6, 2.3, 2.56], [7, 2.56, 2.84], [8, 2.84, 3.06], [9, 3.06, 3.2], [10, 3.2, 3.44], [11, 3.44, 3.96], [13, 4.46, 4.72], [14, 4.72, 4.84], [15, 4.84, 5.32]]}, {"text": "This low supply of talent, constrained by how uncool computers were, resulted in decades of cushy, high-paying, low-stress, high job security [0], with double-digit annual salary increases and the confidence that even if my current job didn’t work out, I could respond to the five recruiters who cold-emailed me this week asking for an interview.", "block": 4, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/2fa27da8f748b94a7151f59d7a45bfb470734c366dbff3deb5524f23de79ec62.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.26], [1, 0.26, 0.46], [2, 0.46, 0.84], [3, 0.84, 1.02], [4, 1.02, 1.54], [6, 2.42, 2.72], [7, 2.72, 2.92], [8, 2.92, 3.34], [9, 3.34, 3.84], [10, 3.84, 4.1], [11, 4.86, 5.06], [12, 5.06, 5.32], [13, 5.32, 5.64], [14, 5.64, 5.9], [15, 5.9, 6.4], [18, 8.62, 8.8], [19, 8.8, 8.98], [20, 8.98, 9.58], [22, 10.0, 10.24], [24, 11.08, 11.4], [25, 11.4, 11.74], [26, 11.74, 12.32], [27, 12.32, 12.68], [28, 12.68, 12.78], [29, 12.78, 13.2], [30, 13.2, 13.48], [31, 13.48, 13.74], [32, 13.74, 13.94], [33, 13.94, 14.08], [34, 14.08, 14.38], [35, 14.38, 14.72], [36, 14.72, 15.1], [37, 15.1, 15.3], [38, 15.3, 15.62], [39, 16.2, 16.38], [40, 16.38, 16.52], [41, 16.52, 16.82], [42, 16.82, 17.1], [43, 17.1, 17.22], [45, 17.42, 18.06], [46, 18.06, 18.16], [48, 18.66, 18.86], [49, 18.86, 19.06], [50, 19.06, 19.22], [51, 19.22, 19.64], [52, 19.64, 19.9], [53, 19.9, 20.02], [54, 20.02, 20.4]]}, {"text": "I remember looking around the room in college (and in my 20s), confused about why more women weren’t interested in tech.", "block": 5, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/1f75269d2ee9a9067945a82bff8ca2d2ccbd8923e1023b82f79314bcf9d6a75a.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.18], [1, 0.18, 0.42], [2, 0.42, 0.74], [3, 0.74, 0.98], [4, 0.98, 1.14], [5, 1.14, 1.28], [6, 1.28, 1.4], [7, 1.4, 1.72], [8, 1.72, 2.04], [9, 2.04, 2.14], [10, 2.14, 2.28], [11, 2.28, 2.86], [12, 3.04, 3.32], [13, 3.32, 3.66], [14, 3.66, 3.92], [15, 3.92, 4.12], [16, 4.12, 4.44], [17, 4.44, 4.74], [18, 4.74, 5.1], [19, 5.1, 5.3], [20, 5.3, 5.56]]}, {"text": "The jobs pay very well and offer a lot of flexibility in all the ways you’d want it (easy to find a new job if you’re not happy at your current one, unlimited PTO, flexible schedules, etc.).", "block": 5, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/73952764732d2a3e81ffc03d2fa40c49655e195aa4676ea0949d556bcb228f0c.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.2], [1, 0.2, 0.44], [2, 0.44, 0.72], [3, 0.72, 1.04], [4, 1.04, 1.36], [5, 1.36, 1.7], [6, 1.7, 2.0], [7, 2.0, 2.22], [8, 2.22, 2.4], [9, 2.4, 2.54], [10, 2.54, 3.0], [11, 3.0, 3.4], [12, 3.4, 3.6], [13, 3.6, 3.74], [14, 3.74, 3.92], [15, 3.92, 4.22], [16, 4.22, 4.36], [17, 4.36, 4.66], [18, 5.04, 5.32], [19, 5.32, 5.46], [20, 5.46, 5.66], [21, 5.66, 5.82], [22, 5.82, 5.96], [23, 5.96, 6.22], [24, 6.22, 6.42], [25, 6.42, 6.56], [26, 6.56, 6.66], [27, 6.66, 7.02], [28, 7.02, 7.18], [29, 7.18, 7.28], [30, 7.28, 7.5], [31, 7.5, 7.74], [32, 8.22, 8.5], [33, 8.5, 9.12], [34, 9.54, 9.84], [35, 9.84, 10.34], [36, 10.86, 11.08]]}, {"text": "It’s always been my dream to start my own startup.", "block": 6, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/1d48f09b861d1d39acfe8c8152b4598f8d94b496039bce07afe2f36c81fc3be3.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.22], [1, 0.22, 0.38], [2, 0.38, 0.58], [3, 0.58, 0.76], [4, 0.76, 1.06], [5, 1.06, 1.3], [6, 1.3, 1.52], [7, 1.52, 1.72], [8, 1.72, 1.88], [9, 1.88, 2.28]]}, {"text": "I’ve made a few attempts during that time, but nothing was ever as successful as my career working for others.", "block": 6, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/f01d565b47bdf78301f57e97051f63fffd2e7f3763a2cec5fe12775afcf3bf89.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.28], [1, 0.28, 0.38], [2, 0.38, 0.52], [3, 0.52, 0.7], [4, 0.7, 1.14], [5, 1.14, 1.46], [6, 1.46, 1.64], [7, 1.64, 1.94], [8, 2.46, 2.62], [9, 2.62, 2.86], [10, 2.86, 3.06], [11, 3.06, 3.28], [12, 3.28, 3.5], [13, 3.5, 4.0], [14, 4.0, 4.22], [15, 4.22, 4.34], [16, 4.34, 4.66], [17, 4.66, 4.98], [18, 4.98, 5.2], [19, 5.2, 5.44]]}, {"text": "But in 2022, the world has changed.", "block": 7, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/d3823729c148ee354a819df9009dee2b64ef6c5b449d8a653df3f2ba46042865.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.18], [1, 0.18, 0.32], [2, 0.32, 1.04], [3, 1.58, 1.66], [4, 1.66, 1.92], [5, 1.92, 2.18], [6, 2.18, 2.84]]}, {"text": "Not because technology is unimportant or humans are replaced with AI.", "block": 8, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/1932888edf63d3788ac89d02c6199ad34f2aea98fe313d66661c10f1acd5c6be.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.32], [1, 0.32, 0.58], [2, 0.58, 1.2], [3, 1.2, 1.7], [4, 1.7, 2.24], [5, 2.24, 2.58], [6, 2.58, 2.92], [7, 2.92, 3.16], [8, 3.16, 3.5], [9, 3.5, 3.8], [10, 3.8, 4.1]]}, {"text": "Software, data, and infrastructure will continue to shape the global economy.", "block": 8, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/103ee7c448e7cf092acd6d793a3f2bddfd5b8e9c2aab726ae7fcd4ae8ec5ea16.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.46], [1, 0.62, 0.76], [2, 1.0, 1.04], [3, 1.04, 1.48], [4, 1.48, 1.8], [5, 1.8, 2.14], [6, 2.14, 2.34], [7, 2.34, 2.52], [8, 2.52, 2.72], [9, 2.72, 2.92], [10, 2.92, 3.42]]}, {"text": "But the career dynamics that made tech uniquely attractive between roughly 2010 and 2021 have changed in fundamental ways.", "block": 8, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/64bc76293ecba64f6d1f36d1b48c8a9f6c75aa9c4bd73231a563c43a14f1c2a4.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.2], [1, 0.2, 0.3], [2, 0.3, 0.56], [3, 0.56, 1.04], [4, 1.04, 1.34], [5, 1.34, 1.48], [6, 1.48, 1.76], [7, 1.76, 2.16], [8, 2.16, 2.68], [9, 2.68, 3.12], [10, 3.12, 3.56], [11, 3.56, 4.14], [12, 4.14, 4.42], [13, 4.42, 5.1], [14, 5.1, 5.58], [15, 5.58, 6.0], [16, 6.0, 6.16], [17, 6.16, 6.48], [18, 6.48, 6.96]]}, {"text": "There is a popular narrative that AI will “replace tech workers.”", "block": 9, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/e0c259d455e2e84d41ce5ab8ecb034c3515986c889f4e256f654878f782fda1c.mp3", "words": [[2, 0.28, 0.36], [3, 0.36, 0.76], [4, 0.76, 1.26], [5, 1.26, 1.56], [6, 1.56, 1.8], [7, 1.8, 2.08], [8, 2.08, 2.52], [9, 2.52, 2.9], [10, 2.9, 3.28]]}, {"text": "I don’t agree with that framing.", "block": 9, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/29f7682dbed526c93089e139aeba9c3d7569f8f9f5fd2da7d2a843799a909140.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.28], [1, 0.28, 0.38], [2, 0.38, 0.62], [3, 0.62, 0.84], [4, 0.84, 0.94], [5, 0.94, 1.3]]}, {"text": "AI is a productivity multiplier.", "block": 10, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/e0ceb25504a8394e105013d65e4707bb204da15724da80c61cde719c1cb808d5.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.32], [1, 0.32, 0.56], [2, 0.56, 0.64], [3, 0.64, 1.18], [4, 1.18, 1.88]]}, {"text": "It changes how work is done, not whether the work exists at all.", "block": 10, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/a1e9581e078bce412f4b47e8288418115a90b561122375e7b00e18711a1ca976.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.18], [1, 0.18, 0.52], [2, 0.52, 0.74], [3, 0.74, 0.94], [4, 0.94, 1.16], [5, 1.16, 1.34], [6, 1.64, 1.84], [7, 1.84, 2.08], [8, 2.08, 2.24], [9, 2.24, 2.4], [10, 2.4, 2.74], [11, 2.74, 3.02], [12, 3.02, 3.24]]}, {"text": "Skilled engineers who understand systems, trade-offs, and real-world constraints are still necessary—and will be for the foreseeable future.", "block": 10, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/22e8d7ccd3791946488f060d225320333530328c7df54aac528cfcd59a3caec7.mp3"}, {"text": "The larger issue I see in my own career is simpler and more uncomfortable:", "block": 11, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/2543df0769d5710939b03d140749dfa9266ecc209ee4f7df03398ae5508104d9.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.16], [1, 0.16, 0.46], [2, 0.46, 0.8], [3, 0.8, 0.98], [4, 0.98, 1.18], [5, 1.18, 1.28], [6, 1.28, 1.4], [7, 1.4, 1.56], [8, 1.56, 1.86], [9, 1.86, 2.1], [10, 2.1, 2.52], [11, 2.52, 2.76], [12, 2.76, 2.92], [13, 2.92, 3.36]]}, {"text": "Too many people have become software engineers, and job growth has slowed.", "block": 12, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/58616f356d75c22e3fdf535b6914d38230888fb3c2d2c7888a3d5795938ebbe1.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.2], [1, 0.2, 0.36], [2, 0.36, 0.66], [3, 0.66, 0.84], [4, 0.84, 1.1], [5, 1.1, 1.56], [6, 1.56, 2.06], [7, 2.06, 2.4], [8, 2.4, 2.62], [9, 2.62, 2.86], [10, 2.86, 3.12], [11, 3.12, 3.4]]}, {"text": "The world is flatter: in 2010, for an Indian, Vietnamese, or Chinese person to learn programming, they first needed to learn English before they could write their first line of code.", "block": 13, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/df22364a585f84f398ce456ab00ed71f0e7d2418b4cd559abfc359411c69ac78.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.16], [1, 0.16, 0.38], [2, 0.38, 0.8], [3, 0.8, 1.22], [4, 1.7, 1.8], [5, 1.8, 2.5], [6, 2.92, 2.96], [7, 2.96, 3.08], [8, 3.08, 3.58], [9, 3.78, 4.0], [10, 4.52, 4.64], [11, 4.64, 5.0], [12, 5.0, 5.48], [13, 5.48, 5.72], [14, 5.72, 5.9], [15, 5.9, 6.48], [16, 6.9, 7.08], [17, 7.08, 7.28], [18, 7.28, 7.62], [19, 7.62, 7.8], [20, 7.8, 7.96], [21, 7.96, 8.32], [22, 8.32, 8.78], [23, 8.78, 9.06], [24, 9.06, 9.22], [25, 9.22, 9.36], [26, 9.36, 9.54], [27, 9.54, 9.82], [28, 9.82, 10.04], [29, 10.04, 10.18], [30, 10.18, 10.46]]}, {"text": "Now, coding education exists in so many languages that there are tons of highly talented engineers who don’t know English.", "block": 13, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/95a4bc48ef265046364e74312078bd53fc63dc8924b53f4b63a6b6ddc121923f.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.42], [1, 1.12, 1.5], [2, 1.5, 2.14], [3, 2.14, 2.62], [4, 2.62, 2.98], [5, 2.98, 3.24], [6, 3.24, 3.44], [7, 3.44, 3.86], [8, 3.86, 4.32], [9, 4.32, 4.5], [10, 4.5, 4.64], [11, 4.64, 4.94], [12, 4.94, 5.18], [13, 5.18, 5.44], [14, 5.44, 5.96], [15, 5.96, 6.5], [16, 6.5, 6.88], [17, 6.88, 7.2], [18, 7.2, 7.32], [19, 7.32, 7.68]]}, {"text": "When Supply Outruns Demand", "block": 14, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/a91ee7686ff128c763daeda35727fd518bbb8191b169cc925f082c96b6cd22a5.mp3"}, {"text": "For a long time, software engineering was not considered a “cool” career.", "block": 15, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/74291fc8db96aa27f01c0a33e11aa5796cb6ad3c24000e82be4801628b1688c5.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.26], [1, 0.26, 0.38], [2, 0.38, 0.56], [3, 0.56, 0.98], [4, 1.28, 1.62], [5, 1.62, 2.22], [6, 2.22, 2.64], [7, 2.64, 2.92], [8, 2.92, 3.44], [9, 3.44, 3.7], [10, 3.7, 4.02], [11, 4.02, 4.48]]}, {"text": "Before 2015, it attracted a relatively small group of people.", "block": 15, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/39cf000668d3b957ae42e731f1a57d59391e8474a9e29406047ccd73d71192da.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.3], [1, 0.3, 1.04], [2, 1.28, 1.34], [3, 1.34, 1.64], [4, 1.64, 1.88], [5, 1.88, 2.2], [6, 2.2, 2.66], [7, 2.66, 2.98], [8, 2.98, 3.14], [9, 3.14, 3.46]]}, {"text": "As a result, demand vastly exceeded supply, and salaries rose rapidly.", "block": 15, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/7665385627b8b577ba4afae5b55f38cf21cbf14febc937b146ef494309872176.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.2], [1, 0.2, 0.3], [2, 0.3, 0.6], [3, 0.7, 0.9], [4, 0.9, 1.34], [5, 1.34, 1.76], [6, 1.76, 2.18], [7, 2.18, 2.42], [8, 2.42, 2.8], [9, 2.8, 3.1], [10, 3.1, 3.52]]}, {"text": "After 2015, that changed.", "block": 16, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/6dc83581fd48c41f88efe69a210467c6971e17c985cd10ea8d710d62ebcc2268.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.34], [1, 0.34, 1.04], [2, 1.52, 1.66], [3, 1.66, 2.18]]}, {"text": "Coding became aspirational.", "block": 17, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/53c54005bf4477f73433e2a751e89c3112fa4404552c2cfb34e33fd1f631b76f.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.38], [1, 0.38, 0.7], [2, 0.7, 1.5]]}, {"text": "Universities expanded computer science programs.", "block": 17, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/850c0e340b56a619eff883e313dab6abfdd16e88e35d895fc4951b6f3d7b5d7d.mp3", "words": [[1, 0.84, 1.18], [2, 1.18, 1.54], [3, 1.54, 1.92], [4, 1.92, 2.38]]}, {"text": "Bootcamps exploded.", "block": 17, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/691d4cfff387c9c0ad2b8b9f10f13b708e8e0f5d8ca65244191d4c5f77ee07c6.mp3"}, {"text": "Online influencers promised six-figure salaries in months.", "block": 17, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/84a4e3379c688d381d7f56205a041fe3a1eacac20e71f094aa7e79c824bb1b28.mp3"}, {"text": "In the COVID years (2020-2022), online influencers bragged about their WFH six-figure jobs (where the H in WFH meant “home”), and the number of graduates more than doubled in a decade.", "block": 17, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/2cb99c3555c64dd887dff95c43ace44e17dfb25f2a4f296c8c98261e2d801e52.mp3"}, {"text": "At the same time, the tech industry’s growth rate slowed.", "block": 18, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/91890dc64fc4f82e03c4077c322bce3ebb44368e4b2d74b2a3dc60c32029c7e6.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.2], [1, 0.2, 0.3], [2, 0.3, 0.5], [3, 0.5, 0.96], [4, 1.18, 1.26], [5, 1.26, 1.46], [6, 1.46, 2.02], [7, 2.02, 2.22], [8, 2.22, 2.44], [9, 2.44, 2.76]]}, {"text": "The result is a collapse in the entry-level job market and a painful experience for more senior talent and H-1B visa holders.", "block": 19, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/92a6843ac03fa84d1f8f90a7aa64deade6bab3fa9874fd99769eb59d2cf4cc3c.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.14], [1, 0.14, 0.4], [2, 0.4, 0.64], [3, 0.64, 0.76], [4, 0.76, 1.06], [5, 1.06, 1.34], [6, 1.34, 1.42], [8, 1.92, 2.18], [9, 2.18, 2.58], [11, 2.9, 3.0], [12, 3.0, 3.28], [13, 3.28, 3.84], [14, 3.84, 4.1], [15, 4.1, 4.28], [16, 4.28, 4.58], [17, 4.58, 4.96], [18, 4.96, 5.24], [19, 5.24, 5.76], [20, 5.76, 6.06], [21, 6.06, 6.36]]}, {"text": "A Useful Comparison: English Teaching in Vietnam", "block": 20, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/31c676f9f85c0776644f37b0abcd173b600731f2bdc754003bad639805858205.mp3", "words": [[1, 0.0, 0.46], [2, 0.46, 1.12], [3, 1.6, 1.82], [4, 1.82, 2.28], [5, 2.28, 2.5], [6, 2.5, 2.84]]}, {"text": "A relatable example is the English-teaching market in Vietnam.", "block": 21, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/93a3272eb4c226df014f3841b127bb913d5cbaac9c2246e79451dfa99ce1f8bd.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.18], [1, 0.18, 0.52], [2, 0.52, 1.04], [3, 1.04, 1.34], [4, 1.34, 1.44], [6, 2.12, 2.46], [7, 2.46, 2.68], [8, 2.68, 3.02]]}, {"text": "From around 2010 to 2019, English teaching was extraordinarily lucrative for Westerners.", "block": 22, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/de8ed67da062f84aa7f2b39e715effe81f3b8adc2c63f6fdb87ba68a9295bbdc.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.14], [1, 0.14, 0.4], [2, 0.4, 0.92], [3, 0.92, 1.16], [4, 1.16, 1.96], [5, 2.4, 2.62], [6, 2.62, 3.04], [7, 3.04, 3.24], [8, 3.24, 3.84], [9, 3.84, 4.6], [10, 4.6, 4.84], [11, 4.84, 5.48]]}, {"text": "Demand was high, supply was limited, and so quality standards dropped to meet the low supply.", "block": 22, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/a370ea5ef0dd2efc66aabc24f8eb297bc60838f9ebc97fefc577ad6d3ef3f5b7.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.44], [1, 0.44, 0.64], [2, 0.64, 0.88], [3, 1.28, 1.52], [4, 1.52, 1.76], [5, 1.76, 2.08], [6, 2.38, 2.48], [7, 2.48, 2.64], [8, 2.64, 2.96], [11, 3.76, 4.06], [12, 4.06, 4.22], [13, 4.22, 4.36], [14, 4.36, 4.54], [15, 4.54, 4.88]]}, {"text": "Many schools hired teachers with no degrees, no experience, and sometimes not even native-level English—so long as they “looked Western.”", "block": 22, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/39c4a99d8cb8932b1932d2e84efd9662182a9fc5268677fd783499ea6a1fcb10.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.36], [1, 0.36, 0.7], [2, 0.7, 1.04], [3, 1.04, 1.48], [4, 1.48, 1.74], [5, 1.74, 2.02], [6, 2.02, 2.42], [7, 2.9, 3.06], [8, 3.06, 3.68], [9, 4.04, 4.4], [10, 4.4, 4.8], [11, 4.8, 5.16], [12, 5.16, 5.4], [15, 6.62, 6.82], [16, 6.82, 7.0], [17, 7.0, 7.12], [18, 7.12, 7.4], [19, 7.4, 7.88]]}, {"text": "That era ended in 2019.", "block": 23, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/10b8599b7c695abfa5b0e71f392f7404b73c6aadfb49363749608747a35fa708.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.24], [1, 0.24, 0.52], [2, 0.52, 0.9], [3, 0.9, 1.14], [4, 1.14, 1.78]]}, {"text": "Demand for English education is still strong, but supply has exploded:", "block": 24, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/102bff68fa1320fe90582490f08585688b1fac11d0656bb82488a7affe7d0e82.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.38], [1, 0.38, 0.52], [2, 0.52, 0.78], [3, 0.78, 1.36], [4, 1.36, 1.54], [5, 1.54, 1.72], [6, 1.72, 2.16], [7, 2.32, 2.4], [8, 2.4, 2.74], [9, 2.74, 2.98], [10, 2.98, 3.5]]}, {"text": "Vietnamese teachers can now teach English effectively.", "block": 25, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/b52f4c436b6837f6daa403799f9ff54df8b39a9fce6d8ebfc1658cf244e354ee.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.34], [1, 0.34, 0.96], [2, 0.96, 1.24], [3, 1.24, 1.44], [4, 1.44, 1.66], [5, 1.66, 2.02], [6, 2.02, 2.64]]}, {"text": "Filipino teachers have excellent English at much lower wages.", "block": 26, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/a4e6c0dab9280e69bfba02f7cb57de96dab802249b7b673406c042e220e3628c.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.28], [1, 0.28, 0.88], [2, 0.88, 1.16], [3, 1.16, 1.62], [4, 1.62, 2.06], [5, 2.06, 2.26], [6, 2.26, 2.58], [7, 2.58, 2.84], [8, 2.84, 3.18]]}, {"text": "Many foreigners accept lower pay because the salary and Vietnamese lifestyle still exceed what they have back home.", "block": 27, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/4f375ea7f579856d5ac5a3526381548bd8fbad839bc5886ce1f8852934010cb9.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.36], [1, 0.36, 0.74], [2, 0.74, 1.18], [3, 1.18, 1.46], [4, 1.46, 1.76], [5, 1.76, 2.1], [6, 2.1, 2.3], [7, 2.3, 2.7], [8, 2.7, 2.86], [9, 2.86, 3.24], [10, 3.24, 3.72], [11, 3.72, 4.22], [12, 4.22, 4.6], [13, 4.6, 4.88], [14, 4.88, 5.02], [15, 5.02, 5.16], [16, 5.16, 5.4], [17, 5.4, 5.72]]}, {"text": "The job still exists, but the power dynamics have changed.", "block": 28, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/331d1f8e874ecb05eb566cf31d794960f3cc1bf54186edb2b6b09b09aeef464b.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.16], [1, 0.16, 0.32], [2, 0.32, 0.56], [3, 0.56, 1.04], [4, 1.28, 1.34], [5, 1.34, 1.48], [6, 1.48, 1.76], [7, 1.76, 2.24], [8, 2.24, 2.52], [9, 2.52, 2.9]]}, {"text": "Tech is experiencing the same shift.", "block": 29, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/b1c48f73396679d7b1d5e67f20baa16c905fe0dd8803d5b4f147308a07332665.mp3"}, {"text": "Globalization Changes the Equation", "block": 30, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/f0311c423ede22c401d83f39fadfeffd949ca282b823a3133e4942136551e95e.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.76], [1, 0.76, 1.3], [2, 1.3, 1.56], [3, 1.56, 1.98]]}, {"text": "Most of my observations apply to the U.S. job market, where competition has intensified significantly.", "block": 31, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/8db22d50bcca3dfa8bcf7a2ee9b54718545fe2ceca6ca0aa69ba9bdde3d8f614.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.24], [1, 0.24, 0.4], [2, 0.4, 0.52], [3, 0.52, 1.06], [4, 1.06, 1.38], [5, 1.38, 1.58], [6, 1.58, 1.68], [7, 1.68, 1.92], [8, 1.92, 2.22], [9, 2.22, 2.62], [10, 3.02, 3.14], [11, 3.14, 3.58], [12, 3.58, 3.88], [13, 3.88, 4.42], [14, 4.42, 5.08]]}, {"text": "However, this is not universally bad news.", "block": 32, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/972b0fbbaa38629e17f713fe5af134586896279077d6c90c025960eb292b6a54.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.26], [1, 0.44, 0.58], [2, 0.58, 0.7], [3, 0.7, 0.94], [4, 0.94, 1.5], [5, 1.5, 1.78], [6, 1.78, 2.1]]}, {"text": "Western companies will continue to move work to lower-cost regions.", "block": 33, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/5f80f26145a111346a5c4578654b83109e0d480b788162c41bb7866df95e15d7.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.32], [1, 0.32, 0.8], [2, 0.8, 1.04], [3, 1.04, 1.44], [4, 1.44, 1.64], [5, 1.64, 1.8], [6, 1.8, 2.14], [7, 2.14, 2.34], [9, 2.92, 3.32]]}, {"text": "In Southeast Asia, Eastern Europe, and parts of Latin America, tech job markets are still growing.", "block": 33, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/b3c045561c4d1dfb53960e0fc30001fadd3afa54b6d0f99b3b013032ea9085e6.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.2], [1, 0.2, 0.58], [2, 0.58, 1.14], [3, 1.6, 1.86], [4, 1.86, 2.22], [5, 2.58, 2.64], [6, 2.64, 2.8], [7, 2.8, 3.0], [8, 3.0, 3.2], [9, 3.2, 3.64], [10, 4.32, 4.6], [11, 4.6, 4.86], [12, 4.86, 5.24], [13, 5.24, 5.48], [14, 5.48, 5.72], [15, 5.72, 6.08]]}, {"text": "This creates an important nuance:", "block": 34, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/e3d60d6178362d5200b554a572cd11300cdcd698238c8eee5ba9fd545677c77e.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.24], [1, 0.24, 0.48], [2, 0.48, 0.66], [3, 0.66, 1.06], [4, 1.06, 1.46]]}, {"text": "The market is harder for average engineers.", "block": 35, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/19f7b01788931fa200cdccd525696d3c4d79af30259c75b5329024996d22dbf6.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.2], [1, 0.2, 0.46], [2, 0.46, 0.66], [3, 0.66, 0.94], [4, 0.94, 1.18], [5, 1.18, 1.48], [6, 1.48, 1.88]]}, {"text": "Strong engineers still do well.", "block": 36, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/6f4f874eb045c3ba1c86589662eb8070f119b4fadf76393e32bedd45d654b4cb.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.38], [1, 0.38, 0.8], [2, 0.8, 1.12], [3, 1.12, 1.3], [4, 1.3, 1.54]]}, {"text": "Geographic flexibility matters more than ever.", "block": 37, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/79381320095f6337a5da053d5e67324628b52ed0971966d6d0c605cfddb79896.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.68], [1, 0.68, 1.28], [2, 1.28, 1.78], [3, 1.78, 2.04], [4, 2.04, 2.24], [5, 2.24, 2.5]]}, {"text": "Why Tech Still Has Value", "block": 38, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/96915420571b7c0dbcf10c1a3c2e76cd98c506c47b09948080c0618e8f3eda3d.mp3"}, {"text": "Despite everything above, I still believe tech is a useful skill set, especially outside the U.S.", "block": 39, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/eb7f37f5370c51f9705f03e6942331de050fdd653be02e0c9a668b309d831a19.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.42], [1, 0.42, 0.92], [2, 0.92, 1.2], [3, 1.52, 1.58], [4, 1.58, 1.9], [5, 1.9, 2.24], [6, 2.24, 2.56], [7, 2.56, 2.8], [8, 2.8, 2.88], [9, 2.88, 3.2], [10, 3.2, 3.54], [11, 3.54, 3.92], [12, 4.2, 4.64], [13, 4.64, 5.12], [14, 5.12, 5.32], [15, 5.32, 5.54]]}, {"text": "Two reasons stand out:", "block": 40, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/9ad82e6a3e11c9f7f9fea6637e7cf1a62e1674f1e6a9ddcab2f039fd9f2e9720.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.28], [1, 0.28, 0.54], [2, 0.54, 0.84], [3, 0.84, 1.16]]}, {"text": "Transferability.", "block": 41, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/1bcfba6a8a7f24f884b136b75556300327c90f300d6d9b86ff8d6c24e63c365f.mp3"}, {"text": "Unlike professions such as law, pharmacy, or marketing (which are often tied to local regulation and language), engineering skills travel well across borders.", "block": 41, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/05f276de578135ae492dedfc773160302f8ecede9ab06b26afdfb219b56d2163.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.3], [1, 0.3, 0.78], [2, 0.78, 1.16], [3, 1.16, 1.36], [4, 1.36, 1.54], [5, 1.82, 2.12], [6, 2.54, 2.58], [7, 2.58, 3.02], [8, 3.38, 3.68], [9, 3.68, 3.78], [10, 3.78, 4.06], [11, 4.06, 4.36], [12, 4.36, 4.56], [13, 4.56, 4.82], [14, 4.82, 5.48], [15, 5.48, 5.68], [16, 5.68, 6.02], [17, 6.68, 7.06], [18, 7.06, 7.52], [19, 7.52, 7.92], [20, 7.92, 8.16], [21, 8.16, 8.48], [22, 8.48, 8.94]]}, {"text": "Stacking advantages.", "block": 42, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/895ff7b73b7e56702e80d03e583ca0408822a4d865075ff5124845ae9c7b8037.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.44], [1, 0.44, 0.98]]}, {"text": "Being great at English and good at coding is still a powerful combination in Vietnam and Southeast Asia.", "block": 42, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/fcef3ae7a6ea82f2123773862f18c3a90bc1ba33ec23325e01e73e591035fa54.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.28], [1, 0.28, 0.58], [2, 0.58, 0.74], [3, 0.74, 1.04], [4, 1.04, 1.4], [5, 1.4, 1.56], [6, 1.56, 1.68], [7, 1.68, 1.94], [8, 1.94, 2.58], [9, 2.58, 2.8], [10, 2.8, 2.92], [11, 2.92, 3.36], [12, 3.36, 3.9], [13, 3.9, 4.42], [14, 4.42, 4.8], [15, 4.8, 5.3], [16, 5.3, 5.68], [17, 5.68, 6.14]]}, {"text": "Tech may no longer be a guaranteed fast path to wealth—but it remains one of the most portable, flexible careers available.", "block": 43, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/702e3ce971a1088388bd739a12e1a25215fed37860e68691f8230c51fafb71f4.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.24], [1, 0.24, 0.46], [2, 0.46, 0.62], [3, 0.62, 0.9], [4, 0.9, 1.08], [5, 1.08, 1.2], [6, 1.2, 1.56], [7, 1.56, 2.04], [8, 2.04, 2.22], [9, 2.22, 2.54], [11, 3.14, 3.64], [12, 3.64, 3.9], [13, 3.9, 4.16], [14, 4.16, 4.26], [15, 4.26, 4.36], [16, 4.36, 4.52], [17, 4.52, 4.92], [18, 5.14, 5.46], [19, 5.46, 5.96], [20, 5.96, 6.44]]}, {"text": "So Where Does That Leave Us?", "block": 44, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/b44ac3fff5c97d007263f2b10c372b4b0b9183d5885a6c261f5cad0f04374e8a.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.16], [1, 0.16, 0.36], [2, 0.36, 0.5], [3, 0.5, 0.64], [4, 0.64, 0.84], [5, 0.84, 1.12]]}, {"text": "The uncomfortable truth is that the tech industry is no longer in a gold-rush phase.", "block": 45, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/e8420e4af94e415bccf8e853f106a2cf1bf22464b63a3069eaa2b55dca44f9b2.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.2], [1, 0.2, 0.66], [2, 0.66, 1.1], [3, 1.1, 1.34], [4, 1.34, 1.56], [5, 1.56, 1.74], [6, 1.74, 1.96], [7, 1.96, 2.52], [8, 2.52, 2.8], [9, 2.8, 3.0], [10, 3.0, 3.4], [11, 3.4, 3.56], [12, 3.56, 3.64], [14, 4.06, 4.4]]}, {"text": "It has matured.", "block": 45, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/3005587674759cffab049deec7494a41139359ab7496587ea2268b59715c95c9.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.28], [1, 0.28, 0.6], [2, 0.6, 1.2]]}, {"text": "That doesn’t mean people should avoid it.", "block": 46, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/a848aa6a24b9c7556096440934d67207d8e6a3dbb46de36b774586f51445e868.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.2], [1, 0.2, 0.46], [2, 0.46, 0.6], [3, 0.6, 0.92], [4, 0.92, 1.18], [5, 1.18, 1.48], [6, 1.48, 1.7]]}, {"text": "It means they should enter it with clear eyes:", "block": 46, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/8b3ee43d0ea90ac255548f64a80f792cb6a3ef5c3113ef51e0b27e1ee702fcca.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.16], [1, 0.16, 0.42], [2, 0.42, 0.66], [3, 0.66, 0.84], [4, 0.84, 1.1], [5, 1.1, 1.26], [6, 1.26, 1.4], [7, 1.4, 1.66], [8, 1.66, 2.06]]}, {"text": "Expect competition.", "block": 47, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/33112cfac0ca1ccb4eac2f5052c63f74453d005716d583654bb9a990f02ec239.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.4], [1, 0.4, 1.02]]}, {"text": "Credentials and real skill are better than pure credentials or skill alone.", "block": 48, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/1d1306b96d1c3ab5bf556d1948d47a1802e1219feaffde95e43a3ada190561ff.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.58], [2, 0.64, 0.78], [3, 0.78, 1.04], [4, 1.04, 1.22], [5, 1.22, 1.44], [6, 1.44, 1.66], [7, 1.66, 1.88], [8, 1.88, 2.3], [9, 2.3, 2.6], [10, 2.6, 2.84], [11, 2.84, 3.18]]}, {"text": "Understand that stability and outsized pay are no longer automatic.", "block": 49, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/0f24c44d985d6ba99638062a975b6972e891fadf5509992ed522a506654760fd.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.4], [1, 0.4, 0.58], [2, 0.58, 1.06], [3, 1.06, 1.28], [4, 1.28, 1.8], [5, 1.8, 2.12], [6, 2.12, 2.4], [7, 2.4, 2.56], [8, 2.56, 2.9], [9, 2.9, 3.36]]}, {"text": "And for those willing to adapt, there is still plenty of opportunity.", "block": 50, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/e252305821dda982aa5db22cf5d9f78f021114003690dc51c34e4613aaa4b385.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.2], [1, 0.2, 0.32], [2, 0.32, 0.52], [3, 0.52, 0.72], [4, 0.72, 0.92], [5, 0.92, 1.16], [6, 1.38, 1.48], [7, 1.48, 1.62], [8, 1.62, 1.84], [9, 1.84, 2.14], [10, 2.14, 2.28], [11, 2.28, 2.78]]}, {"text": "[0] - In college, I read news articles about teens being arrested for even more innocuous things than I did… So glad I didn’t get caught…", "block": 51, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/73a40863fabb2dd44a0e189af2e710bfe1e7dbaa25731892cb51ccdd1719503f.mp3", "words": [[2, 0.98, 1.2], [3, 1.2, 1.58], [4, 2.0, 2.24], [5, 2.24, 2.38], [6, 2.38, 2.64], [7, 2.64, 3.02], [8, 3.02, 3.38], [9, 3.38, 3.64], [10, 3.64, 3.98], [11, 3.98, 4.44], [12, 4.44, 4.68], [13, 4.68, 4.92], [14, 4.92, 5.22], [15, 5.22, 5.76], [16, 5.76, 5.96], [17, 5.96, 6.24], [18, 6.24, 6.36], [19, 6.36, 6.56], [20, 7.1, 7.36], [21, 7.36, 7.58], [22, 7.58, 7.74], [23, 7.74, 7.98], [24, 7.98, 8.08], [25, 8.08, 8.32]]}]}